  3  acm-services/acm-service-ecm/src/main/java/com/armedia/acm/plugins/ecm/utils/ReflectionMethodsUtils.java:59
     the field is declared on the runtime class of the object passed in, found
     by walking that object's own superclass chain, and read from it.
  4  acm-services/acm-service-ecm/src/main/java/com/armedia/acm/plugins/ecm/utils/ReflectionMethodsUtils.java:92
